    "text": "我今朝遲咗起身，但好彩趕到公司。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2-lucky-example-2",
    "id": "hou2coi2-lucky-example-2",
    "text": "呢場雨落得突然，好彩我帶咗遮。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2-lucky-example-3",
    "id": "hou2coi2-lucky-example-3",
    "text": "佢跌親腳，好彩冇大礙。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2-lucky-example-4",
    "id": "hou2coi2-lucky-example-4",
    "text": "我以為考試難，好彩最後Pass咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe",
    "id": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe",
    "text": "好彩冇事"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-1",
    "id": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-1",
    "text": "車禍之後，好彩冇事，大家都安全。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-2",
    "id": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-2",
    "text": "地震咁大，好彩冇事，啲屋企無受損。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-3",
    "id": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-3",
    "text": "遇到大雨，好彩冇事，冇濕晒身。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-4",
    "id": "hou2coi2mou5si6-lucky-safe-example-4",
    "text": "火警發生，但好彩冇事，大家都安全撤離。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious",
    "id": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious",
    "text": "好搞笑"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-1",
    "id": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-1",
    "text": "嗰套電影真係好搞笑，我笑到喊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-2",
    "id": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-2",
    "text": "你講嘅笑話好搞笑，聽到我不停笑。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-3",
    "id": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-3",
    "text": "佢表演啲搞笑動作真係好搞笑。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-4",
    "id": "hou2gaau2siu3-hilarious-example-4",
    "text": "我呢個朋友嘅言行成日都好搞笑，好鍾意同佢一齊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gwai2-really",
    "id": "hou2gwai2-really",
    "text": "好鬼"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gwai2-really-example-1",
    "id": "hou2gwai2-really-example-1",
    "text": "今天天氣好鬼熱，我出咗好多汗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gwai2-really-example-2",
    "id": "hou2gwai2-really-example-2",
    "text": "呢間餐廳嘅飯好鬼好味。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gwai2-really-example-3",
    "id": "hou2gwai2-really-example-3",
    "text": "佢講嘢好鬼快，我跟唔上。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2gwai2-really-example-4",
    "id": "hou2gwai2-really-example-4",
    "text": "呢個問題好鬼複雜，解釋好困難。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2jam1-gloomy",
    "id": "hou2jam1-gloomy",
    "text": "好陰"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-1",
    "id": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-1",
    "text": "今日落大雨，天氣好陰，真係唔想出門。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-2",
    "id": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-2",
    "text": "你聽嗰首歌幾好陰，好似講緊啲悲傷嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-3",
    "id": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-3",
    "text": "呢間屋嘅燈光暗暗哋，氣氛好陰，好似有啲神秘感。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-4",
    "id": "hou2jam1-gloomy-example-4",
    "text": "佢今日成日冇表情，樣貌好陰，似乎有啲唔開心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated",
    "id": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated",
    "text": "好誇張"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-1",
    "id": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-1",
    "text": "佢講嘅故事真係好誇張，聽到我差啲唔信。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-2",
    "id": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-2",
    "text": "你講得太好誇張啦，冇人會相信咁嘅嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-3",
    "id": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋嘅反應好誇張，連啲小事都好似要爆炸咁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-4",
    "id": "hou2kwaa1zoeng1-exaggerated-example-4",
    "text": "你成日講笑嘢都好誇張，令人忍唔住笑出聲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish",
    "id": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish",
    "text": "好垃圾"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-1",
    "id": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-1",
    "text": "呢部電影真係好垃圾，我睇完好失望。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-2",
    "id": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-2",
    "text": "你啲理由好垃圾，完全說服唔到我。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-3",
    "id": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-3",
    "text": "佢嘅服務態度真係好垃圾，唔會再去嗰間餐廳。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-4",
    "id": "hou2laap6saap3-rubbish-example-4",
    "text": "呢件衫質量好垃圾，好快就爛晒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1hai6-really",
    "id": "jan1hai6-really",
    "text": "真係"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1hai6-really-example-1",
    "id": "jan1hai6-really-example-1",
    "text": "我真係唔知你今日咁忙。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1hai6-really-example-2",
    "id": "jan1hai6-really-example-2",
    "text": "你真係應該試下呢個新餐廳。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1hai6-really-example-3",
    "id": "jan1hai6-really-example-3",
    "text": "真係無人可以幫你？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1hai6-really-example-4",
    "id": "jan1hai6-really-example-4",
    "text": "佢真係好叻，幫到大家好多忙。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as",
    "id": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as",
    "text": "一到嚟"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-1",
    "id": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-1",
    "text": "一到嚟我屋企，你就打電話畀我。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-2",
    "id": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-2",
    "text": "一到嚟學校，佢就開始溫書。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-3",
    "id": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-3",
    "text": "一到嚟機場，我哋會即刻見面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-4",
    "id": "jat1dou3lei4-as-soon-as-example-4",
    "text": "一到嚟佢屋企，佢媽媽就會準備好多嘢食。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1lei4-for-one",
    "id": "jat1lei4-for-one",
    "text": "一嚟"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-1",
    "id": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-1",
    "text": "一嚟，我哋嘅預算唔夠，二嚟，時間又太短。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-2",
    "id": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-2",
    "text": "你唔好咁快決定，一嚟唔夠資料，二嚟未諗清楚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-3",
    "id": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-3",
    "text": "一嚟呢度唔方便坐車，二嚟附近冇咩飲食地方。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-4",
    "id": "jat1lei4-for-one-example-4",
    "text": "佢唔想去，一嚟天氣唔好，二嚟佢要做嘅嘢太多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jam1-suspicious",
    "id": "jau5jam1-suspicious",
    "text": "有陰"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-1",
    "id": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-1",
    "text": "呢件事我覺得有陰，好似唔係咁簡單。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-2",
    "id": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-2",
    "text": "佢講嘅故事有陰，我聽得出佢講大話。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-3",
    "id": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-3",
    "text": "呢間公司嘅合約有陰，你簽之前要小心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-4",
    "id": "jau5jam1-suspicious-example-4",
    "text": "我對佢嘅行為有陰，唔知佢背後搞乜嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say",
    "id": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say",
    "text": "有乜嘢好講"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-1",
    "id": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-1",
    "text": "做咗咁多錯，有乜嘢好講？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-2",
    "id": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-2",
    "text": "今次考試失敗咗，有乜嘢好講？繼續努力啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-3",
    "id": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-3",
    "text": "啲證據擺晒喺度，有乜嘢好講？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-4",
    "id": "jau5mat1je5hou2gong2-whats-to-say-example-4",
    "text": "佢已經唔喺度，有乜嘢好講？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5paai4-long-time",
    "id": "jau5paai4-long-time",
    "text": "有排"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-1",
    "id": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-1",
    "text": "我哋今日有排等車，真係唔夠鐘先到。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-2",
    "id": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-2",
    "text": "你想完成呢個工程，要有排時間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-3",
    "id": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-3",
    "text": "今次考試唔容易，復習仲有排做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-4",
    "id": "jau5paai4-long-time-example-4",
    "text": "你有排先搵到好工，唔好心急。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising",
    "id": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising",
    "text": "唔出奇"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-1",
    "id": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-1",
    "text": "佢考到咁高分，唔出奇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-2",
    "id": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-2",
    "text": "天氣咁熱，大家咁早走，唔出奇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-3",
    "id": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-3",
    "text": "佢知道呢個結果，唔出奇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-4",
    "id": "m4ceot1kei4-not-surprising-example-4",
    "text": "公司業績跌咗，對此唔出奇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder",
    "id": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder",
    "text": "唔怪之得"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-1",
    "id": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-1",
    "text": "唔怪之得佢咁叻，原來讀咗好多年書。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-2",
    "id": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-2",
    "text": "唔怪之得天氣咁熱，原來係因為太陽活動增強。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-3",
    "id": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-3",
    "text": "唔怪之得你遲到，原來交通咁塞車。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-4",
    "id": "m4gwaai3zi1dak1-no-wonder-example-4",
    "text": "唔怪之得嗰間餐廳咁多人，因為佢哋嘅菜真係好味。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple",
    "id": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple",
    "text": "唔係咁簡單"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-1",
    "id": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-1",
    "text": "呢件事唔係咁簡單，你要小心啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-2",
    "id": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-2",
    "text": "以為攞到份工就容易，其實唔係咁簡單。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-3",
    "id": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-3",
    "text": "你以為解決問題好快？唔係咁簡單啊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-4",
    "id": "m4hai6gam3gaan2daan1-not-simple-example-4",
    "text": "事情背後有好多因素，唔係咁簡單。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2laa1-no-need",
    "id": "m4sai2laa1-no-need",
    "text": "唔使啦"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-1",
    "id": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-1",
    "text": "唔使啦，我自己可以搞掂。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-2",
    "id": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-2",
    "text": "你幫唔幫手？唔使啦，我已經完成咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-3",
    "id": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-3",
    "text": "我買嘅，你唔使啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-4",
    "id": "m4sai2laa1-no-need-example-4",
    "text": "唔使啦，我唔肚餓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2-ditch-it",
    "id": "m4soeng2-ditch-it",
    "text": "唔想"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-1",
    "id": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-1",
    "text": "我今日唔想出街，想留喺屋企。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-2",
    "id": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-2",
    "text": "佢話佢唔想食呢啲嘢，因為唔啱胃口。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-3",
    "id": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-3",
    "text": "唔想點解釋啦，直接做就得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-4",
    "id": "m4soeng2-ditch-it-example-4",
    "text": "你唔想參加聚會？冇問題，我唔會強迫你。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me",
    "id": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me",
    "text": "唔通"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-1",
    "id": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-1",
    "text": "唔通你今日唔返工？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-2",
    "id": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-2",
    "text": "唔通佢已經轉咗工喇？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-3",
    "id": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-3",
    "text": "你唔通唔記得我哋嘅約定喇？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-4",
    "id": "m4tong4-dont-tell-me-example-4",
    "text": "唔通真係有人偷咗啲嘢？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how",
    "id": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how",
    "text": "唔知點講"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-1",
    "id": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-1",
    "text": "其實我真係唔知點講，因為事情好複雜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-2",
    "id": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-2",
    "text": "你問我點解唔去派對，我真係唔知點講。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-3",
    "id": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-3",
    "text": "當我面對咁多選擇，我有時真係唔知點講。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-4",
    "id": "m4zi1dim2gong2-dont-know-how-example-4",
    "text": "佢啲說話好傷人，我聽完之後都唔知點講。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that",
    "id": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that",
    "text": "唔止係咁"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-1",
    "id": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-1",
    "text": "呢個問題唔止係咁簡單，背後仲有好多原因。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-2",
    "id": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-2",
    "text": "佢嘅反應唔止係咁，仲有好多感情喺入面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-3",
    "id": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-3",
    "text": "情況唔止係咁嚴重，其實仲有啲嘢我哋未發現。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-4",
    "id": "m4zi2hai6gam3-not-just-that-example-4",
    "text": "問題唔止係咁，佢仲有其他嘅擔憂。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly",
    "id": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly",
    "text": "咪係囉"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-1",
    "id": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-1",
    "text": "A: 呢件衫幾好睇呀。 B: 咪係囉！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-2",
    "id": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-2",
    "text": "A: 佢今次考得好叻喎。 B: 咪係囉，真係進步咗好多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-3",
    "id": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-3",
    "text": "A: 今天天氣真係好熱。 B: 咪係囉，我都汗流浹背。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-4",
    "id": "mai6hai6lo1-exactly-example-4",
    "text": "A: 呢個方法真係最有效。 B: 咪係囉，試咗之後成效好明顯。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5gai3-no-choice",
    "id": "mou5gai3-no-choice",
    "text": "冇計"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-1",
    "id": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-1",
    "text": "今天天氣咁差，冇計，只好留喺屋企。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-2",
    "id": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-2",
    "text": "你唔聽我講，冇計，自己承擔後果啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-3",
    "id": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-3",
    "text": "公司裁員，我哋冇計，只能接受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-4",
    "id": "mou5gai3-no-choice-example-4",
    "text": "呢單嘢好緊急，冇計，急住先做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5mat1je5-nothing",
    "id": "mou5mat1je5-nothing",
    "text": "冇乜嘢"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-1",
    "id": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-1",
    "text": "你今日做咗啲咩呀？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-2",
    "id": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-2",
    "text": "冇乜嘢，淨係留喺屋企睇書。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-3",
    "id": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-3",
    "text": "週末去玩咩？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-4",
    "id": "mou5mat1je5-nothing-example-4",
    "text": "冇乜嘢，可能喺屋企休息吓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5so2wai6-whatever",
    "id": "mou5so2wai6-whatever",
    "text": "冇所謂"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-1",
    "id": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-1",
    "text": "你想食咩？冇所謂，我乜都得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-2",
    "id": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-2",
    "text": "至於去邊度玩？冇所謂，你決定喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-3",
    "id": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-3",
    "text": "你講嘅時間改唔改？冇所謂，我冇特別嘢要做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-4",
    "id": "mou5so2wai6-whatever-example-4",
    "text": "呢件事我冇所謂，你自己決定啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point",
    "id": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point",
    "text": "冇謂啦"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-1",
    "id": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-1",
    "text": "唔好再講呢件事喇，冇謂啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-2",
    "id": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-2",
    "text": "佢而家唔肯改，冇謂啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-3",
    "id": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-3",
    "text": "我諗今日落雨，出街冇謂啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-4",
    "id": "mou5wai6laa1-no-point-example-4",
    "text": "同佢講咁多嘢都係冇謂啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none",
    "id": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none",
    "text": "冇就唔使"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-1",
    "id": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-1",
    "text": "你冇錢，冇就唔使買嘢啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-2",
    "id": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-2",
    "text": "冇就唔使幫手，自己做到就得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-3",
    "id": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-3",
    "text": "如果冇就唔使驚，我會安排好嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-4",
    "id": "mou5zau6m4sai2-no-need-if-none-example-4",
    "text": "你冇咩想講，冇就唔使講咁多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly",
    "id": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly",
    "text": "諗清楚"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-1",
    "id": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-1",
    "text": "你要諗清楚先至好決定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-2",
    "id": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-2",
    "text": "快啲諗清楚，唔好匆忙答應人哋。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-3",
    "id": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-3",
    "text": "遇到問題，要停低，諗清楚先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-4",
    "id": "nam2cing1co2-think-clearly-example-4",
    "text": "唔明白就問，多啲諗清楚先好落手做嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure",
    "id": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure",
    "text": "諗唔明"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-1",
    "id": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-1",
    "text": "呢個謎語我諗唔明，真係好難。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-2",
    "id": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-2",
    "text": "你講嘅意思我諗唔明，可以講得清楚啲嗎？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-3",
    "id": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-3",
    "text": "公司嘅新政策我諗唔明，大家一齊討論下啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-4",
    "id": "nam2m4ming4-cant-figure-example-4",
    "text": "佢嘅行為真係令我諗唔明，完全唔似佢以往咁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me",
    "id": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me",
    "text": "你話啦"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-1",
    "id": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-1",
    "text": "A: 呢件事係咪你嘅錯？ B: 你話啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-2",
    "id": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-2",
    "text": "我唔記得帶鎖匙，依家點好？你話啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-3",
    "id": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-3",
    "text": "咁多嘅選擇，你點揀？你話啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-4",
    "id": "nei5waa6laa1-you-tell-me-example-4",
    "text": "你覺得佢講得啱定錯？你話啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed",
    "id": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed",
    "text": "我哋死啦"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-1",
    "id": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-1",
    "text": "我哋死啦，依家啲錢唔夠還貸喇！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-2",
    "id": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-2",
    "text": "公司啲報告啱啱出咗，老闆睇完話：我哋死啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-3",
    "id": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-3",
    "text": "學生會考咁嚴重，我哋死啦，點準備呀？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-4",
    "id": "ngo5dei6sei2laa1-were-doomed-example-4",
    "text": "電腦突然壞咗，啲檔案冇得拎，我哋死啦！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure",
    "id": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure",
    "text": "受唔住"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-1",
    "id": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-1",
    "text": "我真係受唔住佢嘅無理取鬧。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-2",
    "id": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-2",
    "text": "呢個炎熱天氣，我快要受唔住啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-3",
    "id": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋嘅吵鬧聲令我受唔住，想走開。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-4",
    "id": "sau6m4zyu6-cant-endure-example-4",
    "text": "我受唔住咁多工作壓力，真係要休息一陣。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2caang1-stubborn",
    "id": "sei2caang1-stubborn",
    "text": "死撐"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-1",
    "id": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-1",
    "text": "佢死撐自己嘅決定，唔肯聽其他人嘅建議。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-2",
    "id": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-2",
    "text": "即使證據唔支持，你都死撐佢講嘅嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-3",
    "id": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-3",
    "text": "佢為咗面子死撐，唔肯認錯。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-4",
    "id": "sei2caang1-stubborn-example-4",
    "text": "老細死撐唔改條規矩，團隊好難改變。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless",
    "id": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless",
    "text": "死衝"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-1",
    "id": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-1",
    "text": "你咁快死衝落樓梯，真係好危險。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-2",
    "id": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-2",
    "text": "佢成日死衝去做決定，唔諗清楚後果。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-3",
    "id": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-3",
    "text": "考試期間唔好死衝寫，慢慢睇清楚先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-4",
    "id": "sei2cung1-rush-reckless-example-4",
    "text": "佢哋死衝向前，唔怕任何困難。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4go3-whole",
    "id": "seng4go3-whole",
    "text": "成個"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4go3-whole-example-1",
    "id": "seng4go3-whole-example-1",
    "text": "我食咗成個蛋糕。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4go3-whole-example-2",
    "id": "seng4go3-whole-example-2",
    "text": "佢用咗成個禮拜嚟做呢件事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4go3-whole-example-3",
    "id": "seng4go3-whole-example-3",
    "text": "成個城市都停電咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4go3-whole-example-4",
    "id": "seng4go3-whole-example-4",
    "text": "佢嘅成個人生都為工作犧牲咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4jat6-all-the-time",
    "id": "seng4jat6-all-the-time",
    "text": "成日"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-1",
    "id": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-1",
    "text": "佢成日遲到，真係唔掂。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-2",
    "id": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-2",
    "text": "我成日諗起嗰件事，好煩吓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-3",
    "id": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-3",
    "text": "你成日打機，唔通冇其他興趣咩？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-4",
    "id": "seng4jat6-all-the-time-example-4",
    "text": "佢成日笑，人哋聽到都開心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3laa1-forget-it",
    "id": "syun3laa1-forget-it",
    "text": "算啦"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-1",
    "id": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-1",
    "text": "A: 你今日唔想出街呀？  B: 算啦，我stay喺屋企算啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-2",
    "id": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-2",
    "text": "我試吓再解釋一次，如果你都唔明，算啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-3",
    "id": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-3",
    "text": "唔使咁激動，算啦，我哋改日再傾。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-4",
    "id": "syun3laa1-forget-it-example-4",
    "text": "佢遲咗成個鐘，我實在等唔切，算啦，下次啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3sou3-settled",
    "id": "syun3sou3-settled",
    "text": "算數"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3sou3-settled-example-1",
    "id": "syun3sou3-settled-example-1",
    "text": "我哋講嘅嘢就算數啦，唔使再傾。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3sou3-settled-example-2",
    "id": "syun3sou3-settled-example-2",
    "text": "你答應咗嘅事就要算數，唔好遲到。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3sou3-settled-example-3",
    "id": "syun3sou3-settled-example-3",
    "text": "價錢已經講好，咁就算數喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "syun3sou3-settled-example-4",
    "id": "syun3sou3-settled-example-4",
    "text": "今次唔好扭計，我哋就算數先啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tai2cing4fong3-depends",
    "id": "tai2cing4fong3-depends",
    "text": "睇情況"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-1",
    "id": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-1",
    "text": "今晚去唔去睇戲呀？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-2",
    "id": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-2",
    "text": "睇情況啦，如果天氣好，我哋就去。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-3",
    "id": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-3",
    "text": "你嘅工作幾時完成？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-4",
    "id": "tai2cing4fong3-depends-example-4",
    "text": "睇情況，我可能下星期先得閒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6saai3-after-all",
    "id": "waa6saai3-after-all",
    "text": "話晒"
  },
  {
    "filename": "waa6saai3-after-all-example-1",
